  unitName: Sublime Divinity Rinon
  unitId: 50737
  unitNumber: 1721
  description: Though it did not result in an appointment to the role of Oracle Maiden,
    scholars have concluded that Rinon trained extensively in her homeland of Sacred
    Mt. Bari. In fact, she lived a life fit for a high-ranking cleric. Had she become
    Oracle Maiden, the same impressive abilities that made her a candidate might
    have also made her an ideal intermediary between humanity and the gods. Had she
    chosen not to participate in the war with the Holy Emperor, she certainly would
    have been a force for human salvation in the great Grand Gaian war that followed.
  summonDesc: I was such a child then...<br>But just saying that makes me feel old.
  fusionDesc: Thank you.<br>I'm sure you're struggling too. Let's both give it our
    best!
  evoDesc: Maybe I was unprepared.<br>But I understand now. I understand my purpose.
  element: 5
  rarity: 7
